WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.540
Chara-su!

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.690
Is everyone shugo-peppy
again today?

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:08.170
Today Shugo Bomber
will show up again!

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.410
So, let's start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.920
Everyone's Hearts:

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.220
Unlock!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:45.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:51.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:59.190
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:02.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.810
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:52.540
"Shugo Bomber - Part 5"

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:57.890
Egg Warriors, Shugo Bomber!

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:03.550
Hurry Bomber!
Save the Commissioner!

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:09.780
Aww, I wanted to play the
scientist again this time.

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:11.770
Hey, are you sure
it's around here?

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.740
Yes, this is definitely the spot.

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:17.250
I wonder where Su... er,
the Commissioner is?

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.610
Calling us way out here...

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:24.790
Commissioner Su is now in the
clutches of my X Egg Empire!

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.130
If you want to save her,
then surrender!

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:29.450
Everyone, don't come near!

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:30.400
Commissioner!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.080
But <i>she's</i> the one
that called us here.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.850
She dragged you into
this too, Kiseki?

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:36.110
I am not Kiseki!

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:39.620
I am the ruler of the X Egg
Empire, Emperor Kiseki!

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:42.130
The world will be mine!

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:44.210
He's digging it.

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:46.180
Not much different
than usual.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.950
Now, submit, Bomber!

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.300
Don't worry about
me and fight!

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:54.870
The fate of the Earth lies
on your shoulders!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:58.900
It's the final battle, so please
bring it up a notch, okay?

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.430
Bring it up a notch?

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.830
Shugo Iron!

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:11.480
You saved me!
Thank you, Shugo Iron!

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.780
Damn you! In that case...

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:17.340
Emperor Beam!

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.600
Uh...

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:22.810
Commissioner!

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.500
That's going too far, Kiseki!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.120
I just followed the script!

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.880
Are you okay, Su?

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:30.280
Su!

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:36.770
I am not Su. I am the
Commissioner.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.750
That voice...

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:40.820
It's so bright!

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.990
Could you possibly be...

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:46.160
The origin of all
the Bombers...

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.080
The legendary founding
Shugo Bomber...

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.770
Known only as...

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:52.280
Shugo Legend!

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.870
Shugo Legend?!

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:57.130
It's standard that the Commissioner
also has some sort of secret.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.600
Prepare yourself for the final
battle, Emperor Kiseki!

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:04.280
The future of the Earth is at stake.
Give it everything you've got.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:06.850
Fight, Shugo Bomber.

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:07.890
So...

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.490
She just wants the spotlight
for herself.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:11.970
To be continued!

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.960
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.740
Today we're introducing the
Character Transformations!

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.650
The first Character Transformation is...

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.030
Amulet Heart!

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:28.530
Amulet Heart is the form Amu takes when
Character Transforming with Ran!

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:34.610
Her special attack is a spinning throw
of the Heart Rod, Spiral Heart!

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:51.230
Continuing, the second Character Transformation is...

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.320
Amulet Clover!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:05:01.120
Amulet Clover is the form Amu takes when
Character Transforming with Su!

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:05.950
Her special attack uses a
whisk, Remake Honey!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.910
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara
Encyclopedias each week!

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.340
Look forward to it!

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:27.180
Amulet Diamond's
On the Scene!

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:31.510
Diamond, where did you go
to get a present this time?

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:34.260
I went to the place that creates
the Shugo Chara anime!

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:36.590
Ooh, wow!

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:37.940
Please have a look!

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:43.770
Today she's paying a visit to the
Animation Studio, Satelite!

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:47.020
What could they be drawing
on the computer?

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:48.610
Oh, it's Pucchi Puchi!

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:50.200
How cute!

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:56.240
Dokki Doki is drawn by hand,
one page at a time, like this.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:00.540
Hello!

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.420
Director Itou
Shugo Chara Dokki Doki

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.220
Hello.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:08.200
Director, please give me a present for
all the viewers of Shugo Chara Party.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:09.090
Sure.

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:14.640
It's a signed illustration by the
character designer Sai-san!

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.490
I want it!

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:18.890
You can have it if you can
answer my quiz correctly.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:20.600
I did it.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.240
Yay!

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:24.860
Do your best on the quiz!

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:26.610
Here's the question:

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.320
Name as many Guardian
Characters as you can.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:32.250
If you can name 8 of them, you
get 1 signed illustration.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:36.370
If you can name 12 or
more, you get 2!

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:38.000
Now, start!

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:40.110
Ran!

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:41.370
Miki!

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.410
Su!

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:43.370
Dia!

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:44.210
That's the way!

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:45.360
Pepe!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.460
Kusukusu!

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.000
Temari!

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:49.660
Rhythm!

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.940
That's eight!

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:52.210
Daichi!

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.260
Nana!

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:54.350
Good, good!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.170
Musashi!

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:56.170
Only one more...

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:57.610
Uh...

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:59.620
Clover, you can do it!

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:01.590
Yoru?

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:02.660
All right!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:05.610
You got 12!

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:09.190
We got the presents!

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:14.080
We'll tell you how to enter
at the end of the program!

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:13.780
Sorry Japan Residents Only!

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.630
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:24.610
"Shugo Bomber - Part 6"

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:29.460
Egg Warriors, Shugo Bomber!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:32.380
Farewell, Bomber! Farewell,
the days of battle!

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.850
Emperor Kiseki, today
we will finish this!

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:39.180
Impertinent knaves!

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:42.240
Everyone, let's do our best!

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:44.020
Do our best at what exactly?

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:47.450
This is the final episode.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:51.330
So I'd really appreciate it if
you put your heart into it.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.810
The final episode?

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.710
Well, maybe I'll play
along then.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:02.820
This Shugo Fire will not forgive those who
would disturb the peace of the Earth!

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:04.220
R-Ran?

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:09.550
The green earth, the blue sea,
and this beautiful sky...

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:12.580
All the living things trying
to live their lives...

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:14.430
We will protect them!

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:20.680
U-Um, wasn't the point of this
to help exterminate X eggs?

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.480
Well, whatever...

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.480
Justice will never
be destroyed!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.530
Everyone, let's go!

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.150
Bomb-ger!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.090
Once more!

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:35.800
Bomb-ger!

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:48.100
Bomber Justice Final
Dynamic Attack!

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:57.350
Long Live the X Egg Empire!

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:08.320
The battle is over,
and peace has returned to Earth.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:10.620
Thank you, Shugo Bomber.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:14.180
The End

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:13.230
Farewell, Shugo Bomber!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:18.210
For my ambitions
to end like this...

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.160
Your role is now over-dechu.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.790
Y-You're...

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:28.040
From now on the stage is mine,
Demon Lord Pepe-tan's!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:30.640
The battle was not over!

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:33.670
Stand and fight once again,
Shugo Bomber!

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:39.050
Please stay tuned for the new
TV show, Shugo Bomber Sigma!

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.280
Not happening!
Totally not happening!

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:43.160
We're not continuing!

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:44.630
It's over, really!

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:49.150
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:52.080
Today's episode is
"A Heart-Racing Picnic!"

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:54.110
Rikka's family goes
on a picnic.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:57.660
And what could <i>possibly</i> happen?

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.100
Watch and find out!

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:13.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:17.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:27.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:33.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:38.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:43.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:51.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:57.290
I have something to say.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:03.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:09.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:14.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:21.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:37.460
18 - A Heart-Racing
Picnic!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.380
Yay, we're here!

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:42.730
Wow, look at that!

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:44.030
How pretty!

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.200
Lovely!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.520
The weather is nice, too.

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.840
It's the perfect weather
for a picnic.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:51.560
The mountain air really
is refreshing.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.180
Please pick me up again
in the evening.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:00.110
What?

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.640
It's Hikaru-kun.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.030
Good morning, Hikaru-kun.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.600
Good morning!

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:08.030
Good morning.

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:11.610
So <i>you're</i> Hikaru-kun?

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:14.330
You've got a bright looking
face on you.

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:19.350
How 'bout this?
Does it hurt when I do this?

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:22.970
Let me introduce you.
This is my mom and dad.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.720
Okay Rikka, it's war!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:28.120
All right! I'm not gonna lose!

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.200
Oh, my...

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.560
Hey, hey, what's the matter?

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.400
Wait!

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:39.320
What's the matter, Dad?

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.110
I'm not through yet!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.580
What's the hold up?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.210
The two of them sure
are full of energy.

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:47.410
They're more like brother and sister
than father and daughter.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.590
It's lovely out.

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:50.970
I'm glad we came today.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:52.080
Really?

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:55.370
I was pressured into
coming by her.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:59.420
And I don't know what's so
fun about having a picnic.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.400
It doesn't seem like
it has any value.

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.830
You're wide open!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:09.080
Hey, shooting an unarmed
man is cruel!

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.540
Take this, Hikaru!

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:17.520
Nothing cruel about that one.

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:20.310
What's the matter?
You just died like three times.

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:23.800
What a newb!

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.950
If you don't like it,
then fight back!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.100
It's like shooting
fish in a barrel!

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.440
What, not gonna fight back?

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:32.970
You don't like it,
then have at...

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.040
Why, you...

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.230
Run away!

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.610
Ya got me...

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:46.090
Psych!

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:48.180
You did it now!

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:49.470
Take that!

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.460
Hikaru-kun's gotten
in the spirit.

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:53.720
Yeah.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.550
You're not going to join them?

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:57.820
You've got to be kidding me.
I'm a sixth grader...

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.100
I'm not gonna play
with squirt guns...

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:02.520
Wait right there!

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.090
I'm not gonna hold back just
'cause you're my senpai!

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:06.810
I wouldn't have it
any other way!

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:08.880
That's right!
Today we fight for honor!

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:09.870
Take that!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.690
Look, it's a two sword technique!

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:13.150
That's not fair!

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:14.540
Take this!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:17.710
Hey, that was you!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.120
No, it wasn't me!

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:26.570
Seems like they're having fun.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:29.730
Amu-chan's really into it, too.

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:31.870
How relaxing.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:35.220
The clouds in the sky look
like cotton candy.

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:37.390
Ah, that was fun.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.780
I'm beat.

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:41.890
You've all got some good
fighting spirit.

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:44.650
You too, little man.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:52.060
See, it hurts when I do
this, right? Right?

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.060
Stop!

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:53.520
Never let your guard
down, little man!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:54.910
Everyone having a good time?

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:58.340
You all need to dry off
or you'll catch a cold.

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:01.620
Ah, this feels great.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.810
These smell nice.

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:11.580
That's the smell of the sun.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:17.780
Everyone, eat up!

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:21.360
My mom's cooking is the
best in the world!

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.950
Looks delicious.

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:25.250
What are those?

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:28.650
Those are rice balls.
You've never heard of them?

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.760
They're edible?

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:33.180
Try saying that after
you eat one!

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.830
These are delicious!

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.870
I've never had anything
so delicious!

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.030
See?

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.200
Thank you!

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.220
Why are they so delicious?

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:57.920
Why?

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:59.740
Because a mom made
them, you know?

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:00.870
Why's that?

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:02.480
Well, obviously it's...

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:06.630
...Love! It's got to be love!

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:08.360
It's a mother's love.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.340
Love?

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:12.470
Here.

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:15.470
Eggs are very nutritious.

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:20.780
Delicious.

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:26.410
You need to eat up and grow
big and strong, Hikaru-kun.

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:33.300
Okay, eatin's done!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:36.640
So I'm gonna go fishin'!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.100
Good luck, Dad!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.950
Just you wait and see!

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:44.290
He's definitely Rikka's dad...

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.260
He plays to his own tune...

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.570
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.670
Okay! Amu-senpai's It!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.330
Run away!

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:58.530
Please, wait!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.740
Hey! Wait!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.410
Over here!

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.800
This time Hikaru's It!

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:07.850
Huh? Rain?

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:09.130
Oh, no...

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.390
It's not stopping...

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:26.090
Aww, I wanted to play more.

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:28.600
Oh, you've got a bruise.

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:30.970
I didn't notice.

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:34.630
Here, I brought a band-aid.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:37.840
My mom always puts
one in my pocket.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:40.170
Yeah, you are always falling
over, after all.

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:42.580
That's enough outta
you, sheesh!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:45.040
Whatever, just hold still.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.960
And to finish it off...

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:57.490
Chichin Puipui,
Heal Up Quickly Hah!

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:59.390
There, now it'll be fine.

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:00.530
What the heck was that?

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:01.470
A magic spell.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.870
It won't work.

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:04.600
There's no scientific
basis to it.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:07.900
But my mom always
does that.

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:10.100
And they've always healed.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:14.740
Your mom, huh?

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:20.310
Is a mother's cooking that
delicious for every family?

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:21.820
Sure, I think so.

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:24.800
But my mom's is the
best in the world.

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:29.090
Then, are all fathers
like yours?

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:30.160
Sure.

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:33.210
I love my mom and dad.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.250
I don't get it.

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:36.940
Why?

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:39.130
I don't understand.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:41.070
Because I don't have them.

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:47.800
When I was a baby,
there was a traffic accident.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:51.770
So, I don't remember
them at all.

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.860
But, I do have family.

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:11.370
My father's father.

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:15.320
So you mean, your grandpa?

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:16.130
Yeah.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:19.920
What's he like?
Is he like my dad?

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:21.740
No. Not at all.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:25.600
Then, is he kind?

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:40.610
Yeah.

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:53.640
Hikaru-kun, Rikka!

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:54.890
The sun's come out!

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:55.630
Let's go!

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:56.980
Okay!

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:58.210
So, let's go!

00:19:58.210 --> 00:19:58.630
Right.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:05.750
Oww!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.010
Are you okay?

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.000
Yeah.

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.480
We're back!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.940
Welcome back.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.700
Were you okay with the rain?

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:21.230
Sure.

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:22.980
We took shelter from the rain.

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:24.550
Where's Dad?

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.130
Look!

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.950
It's a big one, a big one!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.240
I caught a whopper!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.240
Whoa, cool!

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:33.370
Man, he put up a good fight!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.930
He pulled me into the river
but I got 'im in the end!

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:38.320
A bonito is a not a
freshwater fish.

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:40.440
There shouldn't be any
outside of the ocean.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.850
You caught me...

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:45.780
I thought I'd try and
surprise everyone...

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.890
D-Dad...

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:50.040
He even soaked himself
to play the part...

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:53.020
Here, I brought a change of clothes
for you, so don't worry.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:55.440
That's our mom for ya!

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:01.320
I had a lot of fun.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.840
You make sure to come
do this again, okay?

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:10.700
This hurts, right?
It hurts when I do this, right?

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.880
This is to thank you
for today...

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:15.860
I'll make sure to thank
you nice and good...

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:32.950
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:36.680
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:41.200
Which egg will be
the lucky one?

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:47.080
Guardian Egg Studying Fortune Telling!

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:49.240
First, for those of you who
chose Miki's egg...

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:52.270
Four Shugoluck stars!
Super Lucky!

00:21:52.270 --> 00:21:53.890
Your memory is in top form!

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:56.010
Right now you can memorize
anything lickity-split!

00:21:56.010 --> 00:21:58.090
It's a chance to improve
your grades!

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:00.490
Su's egg is three Shugoluck Stars.

00:22:00.490 --> 00:22:02.620
Read a book for good luck!

00:22:00.490 --> 00:22:02.620
Study Japanese for the best results!

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:04.400
Ran's egg is two Shugoluck Stars.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:06.970
Unless you're driven into a corner,
you won't have the will-power.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:07.270
You might have trouble concentrating
right now.

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:10.670
Finally, for those of you
who chose Dia's egg...

00:22:10.670 --> 00:22:14.340
You get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:22:14.340 --> 00:22:17.520
You might completely forget
some important homework.

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:19.810
Make sure to double check
before going to sleep.

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:22.260
Your lucky item
is a red pencil!

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:26.100
We sure had fun today!

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:28.710
See you next time on
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:32.070
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:33.920
Bye-bye!

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:05.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:09.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:12.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:12.110 --> 00:23:15.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:18.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:18.610 --> 00:23:22.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:28.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:28.020 --> 00:23:33.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:40.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:40.670 --> 00:23:45.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:56.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:59.260
Our Songs!

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:19.890
Sorry! Japan Residents only!

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:12.510
Two people will receive a signed illustration from
Shugo Chara character designer Sai Fumihide-san!

00:24:12.510 --> 00:24:16.170
Please send a completed
postcard to this address!

00:24:16.170 --> 00:24:17.390
We're waiting for
your postcards!
